<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<odoo>
    <!--
        Demo data: a product whose history nobody corrected, which is what this module rebuilds.

        Tablero de distribucion trifasico 12 polos (TAB-DIST-12): 4 bought at 800 and billed, 2 sold
        and invoiced, and a 200 freight capitalised afterwards — all of it with the revaluation
        engine switched off, so it looks like a database that ran for months without it:

          - the delivery keeps its old value (1.600) instead of the corrected one (1.700),
          - the valued Kardex adds up to 1.800 while the inventory is worth 1.700.

        Select its movements in Inventory > Reporting and run "Rebuild Stock Valuation": the audit
        shows 1.600 -> 1.700 and both figures line up again, with no journal entry.
    -->
    <function model="stock.valuation.recalc.audit" name="_valuation_rebuild_build_demo"/>
</odoo>
